    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Setup - Financial Metrics DB\nOne-time setup for the SQL tool. NOT part of the live agent.\n\n1. Create table (safe to rerun)\n2. Build 24 jobs: 3 companies x 8 metrics\n3. Metric Extractor searches the reports and returns JSON (found, value, page, evidence)\n4. Only found values are saved, with verified = false\n5. A human checks each value against the PDF and sets verified = true\n\nDatabase: Neon Postgres (finance), SSL required.",
          "height": 280,
          "width": 520,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "6f35549f-107b-417b-bbf8-9d1c5714331f",
        "name": "About This Workflow",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          32,
          64
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "### Extraction\nAgent searches Pinecone (fetch 20, Cohere rerank to 5).\nModel uses JSON mode so output is always valid JSON.\nPrefers consolidated figures; converts Indian number format to plain digits.",
          "height": 180,
          "width": 420,
          "color": 5
        },
        "id": "a9b262ca-40e0-4f63-9cfe-42b9d96fec3e",
